              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya qara ka jia lameeso, ganna lameeso ka eegi worri Israeli lafa Misiri keesaa bahe, lafa aloo ta gamooji ta Sinai jed'ani keesati, AABBO Waaqi Waaro Woyyuma keesati waan Musani jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sifi Harunini, worra gosa Israeli, manafi balbala worra isaani gula, heda. Nama d'iira ka ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ganna diddamati oli, ka duula d'aqu dandau ch'ufa, maqa t'aafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojja huji suni hojattani, nama balbala toko mataa gosa ch'ufa keesa, ka isani wahelchu, fohad'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami balbala gosa tokoti mataa, ka gosa ch'ufa keesa huji tanaafi gumi Keesaa tohatani, kana:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.5+NUM.1.6+NUM.1.7+NUM.1.8+NUM.1.9+NUM.1.10+NUM.1.11+NUM.1.12+NUM.1.13+NUM.1.14+NUM.1.15+NUM.1.16",
